---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { localePath, type Lang } from '../i18n';
/* Tanggal ditulis tangan: halaman "now" hanya benar per tanggal ini.
   Perbarui tanggalnya setiap kali isinya diubah (kedua bahasa). */
const { lang } = Astro.props as { lang: Lang };
const en = lang === 'en';
const diperbarui = en ? '16 October 2026' : '16 Oktober 2026';
const L = (p: string) => localePath(lang, p);
---
<Base title="Now · Muhammad Maftuh" active="now" lang={lang}>
  <section class="prose">
    <p class="label">{en ? 'Last updated' : 'Terakhir diperbarui'} {diperbarui} · Bandung</p>
    {
      en ? (
        <>
          <p>
            <strong style="color:var(--ink)">Neovarch Agent</strong> is at version 1.4.8. My focus right now: making the
            phone a genuinely comfortable remote for the agent running on the PC — connecting over Tailscale first, then
            LAN — and tidying up the agent’s “brain” (Tempest), which is now the default.{' '}
            <a class="link" href="https://www.neovarchagent.web.id">neovarchagent.web.id</a>
          </p>
          <p>
            At <a class="link" href="https://www.neovarchlabs.web.id">NeovarchLabs</a>, the client order flow is newly
            finished: pay right after ordering, payment status detected automatically, then the order moves from paid to
            in progress, handover, and done — all visible from the client’s own dashboard.
          </p>
          <p>
            For coding agents, I just released three small open-source tools:
            <a class="link" href="https://github.com/Maftuuh1922/leave-no-trace">leave-no-trace</a>,
            <a class="link" href="https://github.com/Maftuuh1922/not-mine">not-mine</a>, and
            <a class="link" href="https://github.com/Maftuuh1922/catch-22-skill">catch-22-skill</a>. All of them run in
            any agent that can run a shell.
          </p>
          <p>
            On the desktop I use Omarchy, so part of my time goes into its ecosystem: Boxtop (already on the plugin
            marketplace), the Neovarch Glass theme, and Omarchy Pocket for controlling the desktop from a phone.
          </p>
          <p>
            Side projects that aren’t out yet: <em>Kabur dari Pocong</em>, a co-op Roblox horror game, and
            <em>Kisah Adab Studio</em>, a tool for a children’s Shorts series about adab (good manners).
          </p>
          <p>
            Want to talk about AI agents, the web, or building something together? Every contact — email, GitHub,
            Hugging Face, LinkedIn, plus my CV — is on the <a class="link" href={L('/contact')}>contact page</a>.
          </p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <p>
            <strong style="color:var(--ink)">Neovarch Agent</strong> sedang di versi 1.4.8. Fokus saya sekarang: membuat
            HP benar-benar nyaman jadi remote untuk agen yang jalan di PC — sambungan lewat Tailscale lebih dulu, lalu LAN
            — dan merapikan “otak” agennya (Tempest) yang kini jadi bawaan.{' '}
            <a class="link" href="https://www.neovarchagent.web.id">neovarchagent.web.id</a>
          </p>
          <p>
            Di <a class="link" href="https://www.neovarchlabs.web.id">NeovarchLabs</a>, alur pesanan klien baru selesai:
            bayar langsung setelah memesan, status pembayaran terdeteksi otomatis, lalu pesanan bergerak dari dibayar ke
            dikerjakan, serah terima, dan selesai — terlihat dari dasbor klien sendiri.
          </p>
          <p>
            Untuk coding agent, saya baru merilis tiga perkakas kecil yang open source:
            <a class="link" href="https://github.com/Maftuuh1922/leave-no-trace">leave-no-trace</a>,
            <a class="link" href="https://github.com/Maftuuh1922/not-mine">not-mine</a>, dan
            <a class="link" href="https://github.com/Maftuuh1922/catch-22-skill">catch-22-skill</a>. Semuanya jalan di
            agent apa pun yang bisa menjalankan shell.
          </p>
          <p>
            Di desktop saya pakai Omarchy, jadi sebagian waktu habis untuk ekosistemnya: Boxtop (sudah di marketplace
            plugin), tema Neovarch Glass, dan Omarchy Pocket untuk mengendalikan desktop dari HP.
          </p>
          <p>
            Proyek sampingan yang belum terbit: <em>Kabur dari Pocong</em>, game horor co-op Roblox, dan
            <em>Kisah Adab Studio</em>, perkakas untuk serial Shorts anak tentang adab.
          </p>
          <p>
            Ingin ngobrol soal agen AI, web, atau proyek bareng? Semua kontak — email, GitHub, Hugging Face, LinkedIn,
            plus CV — ada di <a class="link" href={L('/contact')}>halaman kontak</a>.
          </p>
        </>
      )
    }
  </section>
</Base>
